    "description": "### Impact\r\nBy constructing an invalid WKB of a MultiPolygon it was possible to make `ST_Area` to read data beyond the allocated buffer. This could be exploited for ASLR bypass as a first step in a multi-vulnerability exploitation chain.\r\n\r\n### Patches\r\nFixed in 10.6.28, 10.11.19, 11.4.13, 11.8.9, 12.3.3, 13.0.2.\r\n\r\n### Workarounds\r\nThere is no workaround.\r\n\r\n### References\r\nhttps://jira.mariadb.org/browse/MDEV-40328\r\n",
